WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.740
Hi, and welcome to Toronto Gadgets.

2
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:19.140
We created TG Networking to make it easier for businesses to find the stock they need, and move the stock they already have.

3
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:26.160
Once your business is approved, you can browse available items, post what you need, and let Toronto Gadgets coordinate the next steps.

4
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.620
To get started, apply with your business and contact details.

5
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:37.680
The network is for business-to-business and wholesale suppliers, and our team reviews your application before giving you access.

6
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.100
Once you're approved, you'll receive an activation email.

7
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.880
Open the verification link, then sign in with your portal password to reach your dashboard.

8
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:54.160
In the Market, you'll find two lists: Needed shows what members are looking for, and Available shows stock for sale.

9
00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.780
You can search by product or location to narrow things down.

10
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:02.920
When you have stock to sell, choose Post available items and fill in the product details.

11
00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:08.320
Include the quantity, condition, location and minimum order so we know what you can offer.

12
00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.500
Your cost stays private with Toronto Gadgets.

13
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:16.640
For a longer list, choose Upload CSV and download the matching template first.

14
00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.720
Keep the column headings, add your items, then upload the file and review the rows before you confirm.

15
00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:29.340
If you're looking for products, choose Post needed items and tell us what you need, how many, and when.

16
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.180
Members receive an alert so they can respond through Toronto Gadgets.

17
00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.820
To respond to a request, choose Fulfil and tick the items you can provide.

18
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:43.460
Enter a quantity for each selected item and your delivery time, then send your response to us.

19
00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:51.840
In My posts, you can track requested, offered and Toronto Gadgets-confirmed quantities, and read notifications in Updates.

20
00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:57.580
Supplier identities remain private, and Toronto Gadgets coordinates pricing and next steps.

21
00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.020
An availability response does not confirm an order.

22
00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.580
Keep your stock current by replacing your list when it changes.

23
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:07.840
Each replacement starts a fresh thirty-day period.

24
00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:13.260
If thirty days pass without a replacement, your stock expires and you receive an update reminder.

25
00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.480
Always review the new list before confirming it.
